#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:5
msgid ""
"系统装好了，SSH能连上了，然后呢？`python -c \"import torch; "
"print(torch.cuda.is_available())\"` 返回 `False`——你的GPU还没\"醒\"过来。"
