#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:139
msgid "一键安装：三行命令搞定"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:141
msgid "Debian/Ubuntu上装NVIDIA驱动最可靠的方式是通过官方APT源："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:143
msgid ""
"# 1. 检测你的显卡型号和推荐驱动\n"
"nvidia-detect  # 输出类似 \"nvidia-driver-570\"\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 添加NVIDIA官方APT源（Ubuntu LTS用户）\n"
"sudo add-apt-repository ppa:graphics-drivers/ppa\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"\n"
"# 3. 安装推荐驱动（将570替换为detect输出的版本）\n"
"sudo apt install nvidia-driver-570\n"
"\n"
"# 4. 重启\n"
"sudo reboot\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:158
msgid "重启后验证："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:160
msgid ""
"# 基本验证\n"
"nvidia-smi\n"
"\n"
"# 输出应该是类似这样的：\n"
"# "
"+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+"
"\n"
"# | NVIDIA-SMI 570.86.15    Driver Version: 570.86.15    CUDA Version: "
"12.8     |\n"
"# "
"|-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+"
"\n"
"# | GPU  Name        Persistence-M| Bus-Id        Disp.A | Volatile "
"Uncorr. ECC |\n"
"# | Fan  Temp  Perf  Pwr:Usage/Cap|         Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  "
"Compute M. |\n"
"# "
"|===============================+======================+======================|"
"\n"
"# |   0  Tesla T4            Off  | 00000000:00:1E.0 Off |"
"                    0 |\n"
"# | N/A   48C    P0    28W /  70W |      0MiB / 15360MiB |      0%      "
"Default |\n"
"# "
"+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+"
"\n"
"\n"
"# 桌面环境额外验证：KMS 是否启用\n"
"# 输出 Y 表示正常（官方APT源安装的驱动通常已自动配置）\n"
"cat /sys/module/nvidia_drm/parameters/modeset\n"
"\n"
"# 驱动 545+ 还可检查 fbdev（替代 simpledrm 的 framebuffer 支持）\n"
"cat /sys/module/nvidia_drm/parameters/fbdev\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:183
msgid "Secure Boot警告"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:186
msgid ""
"如果系统启用了Secure Boot（很多预装Ubuntu/Debian的机器默认开启），安装NVIDIA专有驱动后需要注册MOK（Machine"
" Owner Key）：重启时会进入蓝色MOK管理界面，选择\"Enroll "
"MOK\"→\"Continue\"→输入密码→重启。如果不做这一步，驱动不会加载，`nvidia-smi`会报错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:189
msgid "桌面环境安装提示"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:193
msgid ""
"如果你是在带桌面环境的机器上安装（比如Ubuntu Desktop），安装过程中 nouveau "
"开源驱动可能与NVIDIA专有驱动冲突，导致重启后黑屏。建议在安装前临时修改GRUB启动参数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:195
msgid "重启时按 `Shift` 进入GRUB菜单，按 `e` 编辑启动项"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:196
msgid "在 `linux` 那一行末尾添加 `nomodeset`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:197
msgid "按 `Ctrl+X` 或 `F10` 启动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:198
msgid "安装完成并重启后，如果一切正常，可以去掉 `nomodeset`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:201
msgid "混合显卡（核显+独显）PRIME offload 踩坑"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:205
msgid ""
"如果你的机器同时有 Intel/AMD 核显和 NVIDIA 独显，并且想让 NVIDIA 卡通过 `prime-run` "
"处理浏览器、游戏等图形任务，**必须确保核显的 Xorg 配置启用了 DRI3**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:207
msgid "踩坑现象："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:208
msgid "`prime-run firefox` 或 `prime-run glxinfo` 仍然使用核显（Mesa/Intel）渲染"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:209
msgid "`__NV_PRIME_RENDER_OFFLOAD=1` 环境变量不生效"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:210
msgid "浏览器 `about:support` 或 `chrome://gpu` 显示使用 iGPU 而非 NVIDIA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:211
msgid "`vkcube` 无法用 iGPU 渲染，只能走 NVIDIA 路径，但高分辨率下出现类似老式 CRT 逐行扫描的割裂画面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:213
msgid "原因：PRIME render offload 依赖 DRI3，而 Intel 驱动的默认配置可能未启用 DRI3。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:215
msgid "解决步骤："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:217
msgid "**确认核显的 PCI 地址**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:219
msgid "lspci | grep -i vga\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:223
msgid ""
"输出类似 `00:02.0 VGA compatible controller: Intel Corporation ...`，记下前面的地址（如"
" `00:02.0`），稍后在 Xorg 配置中写为 `PCI:0:2:0`（冒号分隔，去掉前导零）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:225
msgid "**创建 Xorg 配置文件**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:227
msgid "新建文件 `/etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/20-intel-dri3.conf`，内容如下："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:229
msgid ""
"Section \"Device\"\n"
"    Identifier \"Intel\"\n"
"    Driver \"modesetting\"\n"
"    BusID \"PCI:0:2:0\"\n"
"    Option \"DRI\" \"3\"\n"
"EndSection\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:238
msgid "将 `BusID` 中的 `PCI:0:2:0` 替换为你在第 1 步中确认的实际核显地址。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:240
msgid "**重启系统**，让 Xorg 加载新配置。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:242
msgid "**验证 offload 是否生效**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:244
msgid ""
"# 应该显示 NVIDIA 渲染器\n"
"__NV_PRIME_RENDER_OFFLOAD=1 __GLX_VENDOR_LIBRARY_NAME=nvidia glxinfo | "
"grep \"OpenGL renderer\"\n"
"\n"
"# 应该列出两个 provider（含 NVIDIA-G0）\n"
