#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:534
msgid "Docker GPU 支持：一劳永逸的环境隔离"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:536
msgid ""
"驱动和CUDA Toolkit的版本兼容问题是深度学习环境配置中最容易出错的环节。**Docker + nvidia-container-"
"toolkit** 可以一步解决这个问题：宿主机只需要装驱动，PyTorch、CUDA Toolkit、cuDNN这些都放在容器里，互不干扰。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:538
msgid "安装配置："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:540
msgid ""
"# 1. 确保宿主机驱动已装好（nvidia-smi 能正常输出）\n"
"nvidia-smi\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 安装 nvidia-container-toolkit\n"
"curl -fsSL https://nvidia.github.io/libnvidia-container/gpgkey | sudo gpg"
" --dearmor -o /usr/share/keyrings/nvidia-container-toolkit-keyring.gpg\n"
"distribution=$(. /etc/os-release;echo $ID$VERSION_ID)\n"
"curl -s -L https://nvidia.github.io/libnvidia-"
"container/stable/deb/$distribution/libnvidia-container.list | \\\n"
"  sed 's#deb https://#deb [signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/nvidia-"
"container-toolkit-keyring.gpg] https://#g' | \\\n"
"  sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/nvidia-container-toolkit.list\n"
"sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y nvidia-container-toolkit\n"
"\n"
"# 3. 配置 Docker\n"
"sudo nvidia-ctk runtime configure --runtime=docker\n"
"sudo systemctl restart docker\n"
"\n"
"# 4. 测试\n"
"docker run --rm --gpus all nvidia/cuda:12.6.0-base-ubuntu22.04 nvidia-smi"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:560
msgid "之后跑任何深度学习代码只需要拉一个带CUDA的PyTorch镜像："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/appendix/environment-setup/nvidia-setup.md:562
msgid ""
"# 使用PyTorch官方镜像（自带CUDA 12.4 + cuDNN）\n"
"docker run --gpus all -it --rm \\\n"
"  -v $(pwd):/workspace \\\n"
"  pytorch/pytorch:2.6.0-cuda12.4-cudnn9-devel \\\n"
"  python train.py\n"
"\n"
"# 或使用NVIDIA的PyTorch容器（已预装所有优化）\n"
"docker run --gpus all -it --rm \\\n"
"  -v $(pwd):/workspace \\\n"
"  nvcr.io/nvidia/pytorch:24.12-py3 \\\n"
"  python train.py\n"
msgstr ""

